        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning the alarm clock kills me. This is a short visual novel about anxiety, cyclicity, and trying to wake up when it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a hero. You're just not sleeping. Because you know: As soon as you close your eyes, it will ring again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarm. Not just a device. He's alive. And he's waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What else awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister comedy on the verge of sleep and madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrealism Parade: milk with eyes, a talking refrigerator and a twin reflection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visual presentation — images only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack, disturbing sounds and loop feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement for hugging the alarm clock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where time is the enemy, and every morning is a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you set your alarm for 07:00 yet? He was waiting for you too.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning the alarm clock kills me. This is a short visual novel about anxiety, cyclicity, and trying to wake up when it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a hero. You're just not sleeping. Because you know: As soon as you close your eyes, it will ring again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarm. Not just a device. He's alive. And he's waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What else awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister comedy on the verge of sleep and madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrealism Parade: milk with eyes, a talking refrigerator and a twin reflection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visual presentation — images only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack, disturbing sounds and loop feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement for hugging the alarm clock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where time is the enemy, and every morning is a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you set your alarm for 07:00 yet? He was waiting for you too.</p>",
